@title Welcome to Larkspur Customer Success
@subtitle A letter for the November 2026 cohort

Dear new teammate,

Welcome to Customer Success at Larkspur Software. We are 42 people across Denver, Dublin and Singapore, and we spend our days helping customers get real value from the product. You will find this team generous with its time and quick to share what it knows, so please ask as many questions as you need.

# Your first week

- **Monday:** laptop pickup at 10:00, then a welcome breakfast.
- **Tuesday:** product deep dive with the Solutions team.
- **Wednesday:** shadow two customer calls.
- **Thursday:** support tooling training.
- **Friday:** lunch with your onboarding buddy.

# Your first 90 days

By day 30, you will know the product well enough to explain it to a customer. Spend this month learning how our accounts are set up and reading the notes your colleagues have left.

By day 60, you will own five accounts. Your onboarding buddy will work alongside you on them, and you will handle the day-to-day contact yourself.

By day 90, you will run quarterly business reviews on your own. Your buddy will still be a phone call away, but the customer will be talking to you.

# People to know

- Nadia Farouk, VP of Customer Success
- Owen Achterberg, Head of Support
- Priyanka Rao, Enablement lead
- Jonas Weber, IT help desk lead

! The #cs-newbies channel is the best place to ask anything. No question is too small.

Welcome aboard. We are glad you are here.

Nadia Farouk
VP of Customer Success, Larkspur Software
